Well, this is my fourth. The first three were in 1999 or 2000, and then
I started playing Angband for a while, then Crawl, then Adom, then
finally last month I got the latest version of Nethack. Fairly
unremarkable game; there was an armor shop with platemail in it on DL 2
and a cursed Firebrand in a general store on DL 3. Too bad it was
cursed, I never actually used it. Well, with the great armor I just got
to level 5, dipped of Excalibur, and nothing touched me after that.
Getting intrinsics was harder than I remember, so I got most of them
just by getting crowned. I opted for YDSM because it's almost a
requirement for getting through the knight's quest in one piece. The
mysterious force in Gehennom was REALLY irritating, especially because
Moloch's Sanctum was on DL 53. Next ascension will be anything but a
lawful character, but I will miss the MMoMerlin. My magic missiles were
chewing through everything really easily. Dump follows. Oh, and does
anyone know if reverse genocide breaks the genocide conduct? I didn't
want to risk it, so I never tried.


